      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TEARS ARE FLOWING (2) is a progressive type worth following up. Former Victorian who had one run for the new yard and placed at first outing before another spell. Looks well placed here and expected to measure up. SASSY ABBEY (4) has been out of the placings in two runs since a break, the latest when fourth, beaten 0.9 lengths, over 1100m at this track. Cherry-ripe now and is expected to feature in the finish. ORDER ONLINE (1) showed early speed from a good draw when resuming last start then battled on well for third, beaten 0.8 lengths, over 1100m at this track. Has the class to take this out. CHARLIE MAGIC (5) missed the placings two runs back then didn't feature last start when 8 lengths away in tenth over 1100m at this track. Beautifully placed and is sure to prove tough to beat. PAFITIS (3) next best.",
